    <h1>About the 26th Annual Review Meeting (ARM)</h1>
    
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>The 26th Annual Review Meeting (ARM) of the Health Sector Transformation Plan (HSTP) is a pivotal event designed to assess the progress of health initiatives and foster collaboration among stakeholders in the health sector. This year's meeting will take place from <strong>November 1-3, 2024</strong>, in <strong>Arbaminch City, South Ethiopia Regional State</strong>.</p>

    <h2>Purpose</h2>
    <p>The ARM serves as a platform for government officials, health professionals, and partners to discuss achievements, challenges, and future directions in the health sector. It aims to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Review the implementation of health policies and programs.</li>
        <li>Share best practices and innovative solutions.</li>
        <li>Enhance stakeholder engagement and collaboration.</li>
        <li>Identify areas for improvement and resource allocation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Significance</h2>
    <p>As health systems worldwide face unprecedented challenges, the ARM provides an essential forum for dialogue and strategic planning. By bringing together key stakeholders, the meeting aims to strengthen health outcomes and ensure that the health sector in Ethiopia continues to evolve and meet the needs of its population.</p>

    <h2>Join Us</h2>
    <p>We encourage all interested parties to participate in this important event. Your insights and contributions are vital to the success of our health initiatives.</p>
    
    <p>If you have any questions or require further information, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:info@arm2024.org">info@arm2024.org</a></p>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>We look forward to welcoming you to Arbaminch City!</p>
